{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600220/extras/806b0d1c785a42b8dc3e2095fdb2be2d.avif?t=1770685220\" width=635 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Woe Reigns Unending</strong> is a horror side-scrolling RPG set among the crumbling ruins of a once great empire. Wield the fragmented magics and artifacts of antiquity to cleave your way through a relentless tide of stygian monstrosities. What, if anything, can be rescued from the ashes of mankind's decadent hubris?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600220/extras/965b6ea212e4694a57d4c200bcee021c.poster.avif?t=1770685220\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600220/extras/965b6ea212e4694a57d4c200bcee021c.webm?t=1770685220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600220/extras/965b6ea212e4694a57d4c200bcee021c.mp4?t=1770685220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the ruins of the citadel, and the decaying labyrinth of structures that lay beneath.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600220/extras/70f41e678743dbfe905db1e781f85e21.poster.avif?t=1770685220\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600220/extras/70f41e678743dbfe905db1e781f85e21.webm?t=1770685220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600220/extras/70f41e678743dbfe905db1e781f85e21.mp4?t=1770685220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge</strong> the remnants of a long lost empire, and rediscover the forgotten history of the ancients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600220/extras/42502c6a79d49f8f5ea4cbe86d4dc1a8.avif?t=1770685220\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600220/extras_big/42502c6a79d49f8f5ea4cbe86d4dc1a8.avif?t=1770685220 width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle</strong> a grim parade of horrors in brutal tactical combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600220/extras/58ebbed92084f1f6855c29ab29d9b19e.poster.avif?t=1770685220\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600220/extras/58ebbed92084f1f6855c29ab29d9b19e.webm?t=1770685220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600220/extras/58ebbed92084f1f6855c29ab29d9b19e.mp4?t=1770685220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600220?t=1770685220","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600220?t=1770685220","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600220/9d5323829ba6d081febf05af9490890207e592f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770685220","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600220/9d5323829ba6d081febf05af9490890207e592f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770685220","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game contains mature themes and imagery that may not be suitable for all audiences.\r\nPlayers can expect frequent depictions of violence, including blood, dismemberment, and scenes of ritual sacrifice. The narrative explores themes of religious fanaticism, psychological trauma, body horror, and societal collapse. Dialogue and environmental storytelling include references to death, grief, betrayal, madness, and spiritual corruption.\r\n\r\nThere are no depictions of sexual acts or sexual violence. However, the tone is consistently grim, with disturbing visuals and dark subject matter intended for a mature audience."},"demos":[{"appid":4123230,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600220/extras/806b0d1c785a42b8dc3e2095fdb2be2d.avif?t=1770685220\" width=635 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Woe Reigns Unending</strong> is a horror side-scrolling RPG set among the crumbling ruins of a once great empire. Wield the fragmented magics and artifacts of antiquity to cleave your way through a relentless tide of stygian monstrosities. What, if anything, can be rescued from the ashes of mankind's decadent hubris?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600220/extras/965b6ea212e4694a57d4c200bcee021c.poster.avif?t=1770685220\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600220/extras/965b6ea212e4694a57d4c200bcee021c.webm?t=1770685220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source s